WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Turn a passage into a flow chart

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Locate the starting point described in the question.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.220
Mark the next actions or events in their logical order.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:17.280
Rewrite each one as a short phrase with a consistent grammatical form.

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:25.720
From a story about a school project, use parallel phrases such as choosing a topic, collecting examples and presenting findings.
